---
import "../styles/features.css";
---

<section class="features-section" id="features">
  <div class="features-container">

    <div class="features-heading">
      <p class="features-eyebrow">
        WHY THIS PROGRAM
      </p>

      <h2 class="features-title">
        將科技帶進醫護現場
      </h2>
    </div>


    <div class="features-grid">

      <!-- 01 -->
      <article class="feature-card feature-card-primary">
        <div class="feature-top">
          <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64">
              <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="8"></circle>
              <circle cx="46" cy="18" r="8"></circle>
              <circle cx="32" cy="44" r="8"></circle>

              <line x1="24" y1="22" x2="28" y2="36"></line>
              <line x1="40" y1="22" x2="36" y2="36"></line>
              <line x1="26" y1="18" x2="38" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>

          <span class="feature-number">(01)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-content">
          <h3>跨域聯合師資</h3>

          <p>
            結合護理、人工智慧、醫療資訊、職治物治師資，
            並串聯臨床與產業導師，從不同角度共同帶領學習。
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>


      <!-- 02 -->
      <article class="feature-card feature-card-light">
        <div class="feature-top">
          <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64">
              <rect x="12" y="14" width="40" height="36" rx="4"></rect>

              <polyline points="23,28 18,32 23,36"></polyline>
              <polyline points="41,28 46,32 41,36"></polyline>

              <line x1="35" y1="24" x2="29" y2="40"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>

          <span class="feature-number">(02)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-content">
          <h3>實作導向學習</h3>

          <p>
            從 AI 概念與程式基礎出發，延伸到機器學習、
            VR、對話式 AI 等應用，將技術實際連結臨床情境。
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>


      <!-- 03 -->
      <article class="feature-card feature-card-secondary">
        <div class="feature-top">
          <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64">
              <path d="M14 18h36v26H32l-10 8v-8h-8z"></path>

              <line x1="22" y1="27" x2="42" y2="27"></line>
              <line x1="22" y1="35" x2="36" y2="35"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>

          <span class="feature-number">(03)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-content">
          <h3>完整學習支持</h3>

          <p>
            透過 TA、業師諮詢、跨域合作與成果展示，
            從學習過程到專題實作，逐步累積成果與學習歷程。
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>